   "stem_html": "What is a fundamental difference between solar sails and sails that are used on sailboats?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1164892,
     "content_html": "Solar sails rely on disorganized strikes from light particles, while sailboats rely on disorganized strikes from air particles."
